{"id":"salutation","lemma":"salutation","pos":"noun","rank":4656,"glosses":["greeting","valediction, complimentary close"],"ipa":"/sa.ly.ta.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ac/Fr-salutation.ogg/Fr-salutation.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"salutations"},"formAudio":{"salutations":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-salutations.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous échangeâmes des salutations.","en":"We exchanged greetings.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to exchange, to swap","l":"échanger"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Mes parents vous envoient leurs meilleures salutations.","en":"My parents send you their best regards.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"relative","l":"parent"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to send","l":"envoyer"},{"g":"them","l":"leur"},{"g":"best, better","l":"meilleur"},null]},{"text":"Transmettez-lui mes bien sincères salutations.","en":"Give him my best regards.","words":[{"g":"to transmit","l":"transmettre"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"sincere","l":"sincère"},null]},{"text":"Mon mari vous transmet ses sincères salutations.","en":"My husband sends his best regards to you.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"husband"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to transmit","l":"transmettre"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"sincere","l":"sincère"},null]},{"text":"Veuillez transmettre mes salutations à toute votre famille.","en":"Please give my best to the entire family.","words":[{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to transmit"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"family"}]}]}